WEBVTT

00:27.400 --> 00:31.680
<i>As far back as I could remember, 
people always said the same things about me.</i>

00:33.400 --> 00:34.310
Trash.

00:34.310 --> 00:35.760
Good for nothing.

00:35.760 --> 00:36.760
Useless.

00:39.260 --> 00:41.430
<i>I was born and raised in the slums.</i>

00:42.180 --> 00:46.160
<i>My parents had neither the 
resources nor desire to feed me.</i>

00:53.840 --> 00:56.910
<i>When I got hungry, I stole, and I took.</i>

00:57.260 --> 00:59.440
<i>Aside from killing, I'd do anything.</i>

01:04.830 --> 01:06.850
<i>I slept when I wanted to,</i>

01:07.830 --> 01:09.680
<i>and woke when I wanted to.</i>

01:14.400 --> 01:16.090
<i>I was free.</i>

01:18.340 --> 01:19.130
Ow.

01:19.720 --> 01:21.770
Hey, watch where you're going!

01:21.770 --> 01:22.850
A street urchin, huh?

01:22.850 --> 01:24.080
Trash.

01:32.440 --> 01:34.860
Please, no more.

01:40.620 --> 01:42.520
That's enough.

01:43.700 --> 01:45.480
Who the hell are you?

03:22.550 --> 03:27.680
<b>Student and Master</b>

03:28.160 --> 03:33.230
We won't find a current leading off 
the island wandering the beach aimlessly.

03:33.230 --> 03:36.000
The sun and sand will just exhaust us.

03:36.000 --> 03:37.980
Stop being right all the time!

03:37.980 --> 03:40.730
It's the best idea that an idiot 
like me is gonna come up with.

03:40.730 --> 03:43.480
There are bugs and monsters in the woods.

03:43.480 --> 03:45.480
We could defeat them by working together.

03:45.480 --> 03:48.870
Now that I know you're a woman, 
I'd like to avoid danger.

03:49.960 --> 03:52.100
You know what? I really 
do want to marry you.

03:52.100 --> 03:53.750
It's way too soon for 
that in lots of ways.

03:53.750 --> 03:57.390
We need to leave this place alive 
before we start thinking about marriage.

03:57.390 --> 04:00.120
Let's play it safe, even if it takes longer.

04:00.120 --> 04:02.260
We'll avoid fighting as much as possible.

04:02.260 --> 04:04.760
Your prudence will make you a good husband.

04:06.640 --> 04:07.890
Huh?

04:12.280 --> 04:15.150
What? Who?

04:15.150 --> 04:17.150
She just fell from the sky...

04:17.150 --> 04:21.400
The forest was... noisy. It was unusual.

04:22.400 --> 04:25.300
I saw the corpses of many Soshin.

04:25.300 --> 04:27.580
Also unusual.

04:28.590 --> 04:30.660
Did you do it?

04:30.660 --> 04:32.660
It turned into a man.

04:32.660 --> 04:35.040
It's a monster. We should run.

04:35.440 --> 04:37.040
Why do you flee?

04:40.230 --> 04:40.920
Huh?

04:41.520 --> 04:42.800
It's pointless.

04:52.270 --> 04:54.060
Not that it matters,

04:54.060 --> 04:58.060
but doesn't it bother you 
when things aren't as they normally are?

04:58.900 --> 05:01.360
I don't like it, myself.

05:09.560 --> 05:13.660
Huh, you move well for a human.

05:26.560 --> 05:29.680
You're fast for a human.

05:31.930 --> 05:32.930
Nurugai-san!

05:34.810 --> 05:36.560
We'll run on my signal.

05:36.560 --> 05:38.290
Don't think about defeating it. Just run.

05:38.290 --> 05:38.690
Okay.

05:38.690 --> 05:41.090
I don't have much stamina, but...

05:43.650 --> 05:46.040
I take pride in the quickness of my blade.

05:57.070 --> 05:58.170
Oh?

06:00.760 --> 06:01.420
Now!

06:21.140 --> 06:22.960
You tore my clothes.

06:27.370 --> 06:29.030
How awful.

06:39.270 --> 06:39.920
Huh?

06:41.720 --> 06:42.540
Ma...

06:42.540 --> 06:43.750
Master!

06:43.750 --> 06:45.920
Run, Tenza!

06:45.920 --> 06:46.760
Yes, Master!

06:52.880 --> 06:54.140
Who is he?

06:54.140 --> 06:56.520
Yamada Asaemon Shion.

06:56.520 --> 06:58.240
My master.

06:58.240 --> 07:00.640
He's blind.

07:00.640 --> 07:03.270
But he's running through 
the forest regardless.

07:03.270 --> 07:05.900
He apparently "sees" using smells and sounds.

07:14.280 --> 07:16.040
We made it pretty far.

07:16.040 --> 07:18.080
Nurugai-ku—I mean,

07:18.080 --> 07:21.040
Nurugai-san, now that this 
guy's here, we'll be okay.

07:21.040 --> 07:25.040
After all, I owe Shion-san my life, 
and he taught me to use a sword.

07:22.050 --> 07:25.040
<b>Tameshi-itto-ryu Rank 4
 Yamada Asaemon 
Shion</b>

07:25.040 --> 07:27.300
He's incredible—ow!

07:27.300 --> 07:31.760
You were relying too much on your speed, 
and your movements were sloppy.

07:31.760 --> 07:34.680
Go for the head or feet first against 
an opponent like that.

07:34.680 --> 07:37.140
I could hear how lukewarm 
your lunges were, too.

07:35.480 --> 07:37.140
Ow!

07:37.140 --> 07:39.320
Each strike should be executed carefully.

07:38.330 --> 07:39.320
Ow!

07:39.320 --> 07:42.760
Not even these circumstances can stop 
you from acting like my teacher.

07:42.760 --> 07:45.000
I'm actually kind of relieved.

07:45.000 --> 07:47.570
You still finish as weakly as ever, too.

07:47.570 --> 07:50.810
Unbelievable. I'm glad you're all right.

07:50.810 --> 07:53.250
I thought the last time 
I saw you would be on the ship.

07:54.000 --> 07:55.820
Do you want me to say something?

07:56.700 --> 08:00.270
Wait a minute, Master. What have 
you been doing all by yourself?

08:02.000 --> 08:05.710
I completed my duty and was on my way home.

08:13.470 --> 08:16.150
Unable to find a current 
leading away from the island,

08:16.150 --> 08:18.040
I kept searching for one.

08:18.040 --> 08:19.600
Just like us.

08:19.600 --> 08:24.230
I found what seemed to be a current 
leading out in just one place, but...

08:25.630 --> 08:29.070
I heard a noise and detected a presence 
like nothing I'd experienced before.

08:29.230 --> 08:32.950
Realizing there were limits to what 
a blind man could accomplish alone,

08:32.950 --> 08:35.990
I searched for others 
who were also heading home.

08:35.990 --> 08:38.100
Please take us there.

08:38.100 --> 08:40.280
Together, the three of us 
can figure something out.

08:40.280 --> 08:42.620
Maybe.

08:42.620 --> 08:44.240
But first...

08:48.630 --> 08:51.940
What are you doing, Master?

08:51.940 --> 08:54.130
It's your turn to explain.

08:54.130 --> 08:55.880
Why are you protecting a criminal?

08:55.880 --> 08:58.640
You were told to execute 
criminals immediately

08:58.640 --> 09:01.640
if they violated the rules 
or the unexpected occurred.

09:02.510 --> 09:04.140
That's what I did.

09:06.770 --> 09:09.860
She tried to seduce me.

09:12.010 --> 09:13.360
So I executed her,

09:13.360 --> 09:15.790
as painlessly as possible.

09:17.570 --> 09:22.480
You seem to be assisting 
that criminal. Explain.

09:22.480 --> 09:25.720
Depending on your answer, 
an execution may be in order.

09:25.720 --> 09:28.630
This child has committed no crime.

09:28.630 --> 09:32.380
I've memorized most 
of the contents of the roster.

09:32.710 --> 09:35.380
I know the circumstances of the criminals.

09:35.380 --> 09:39.760
But the times we live in dictate 
what is a crime, Tenza.

09:40.390 --> 09:44.400
The Yamada Asaemon are 
the blade swung down by the times.

09:44.400 --> 09:48.120
It would be illogical 
for a sword to choose who it cuts.

09:48.120 --> 09:50.400
Above all else, you violating 
the rules could be

09:50.400 --> 09:53.030
interpreted as treason committed 
by the entire Yamada clan.

09:53.480 --> 09:56.530
The actions of a single man 
could threaten the entire clan.

09:57.340 --> 10:01.530
But you taught me how to use a sword.

10:01.530 --> 10:04.290
When I was a homeless scoundrel,

10:04.290 --> 10:08.790
you took me in, even though you 
weren't obligated to.

10:09.250 --> 10:13.300
Because I sensed resourcefulness 
and potential in you.

10:13.300 --> 10:15.400
Then it's the same for me.

10:15.400 --> 10:19.430
I sense there's potential in a world 
where this child can live freely.

10:20.250 --> 10:22.850
You've come to speak like a grown man.

10:22.850 --> 10:24.680
Because of you.

10:25.500 --> 10:29.470
Besides, I know you're a kind man.

10:29.470 --> 10:32.310
I know you'll listen to me 
if I speak from the heart.

10:41.450 --> 10:43.920
I don't get why you'd help people.

10:46.200 --> 10:48.680
If you insist.

10:48.680 --> 10:49.960
All right!

10:49.960 --> 10:52.630
See? He's a good person.

10:52.630 --> 10:53.960
Uh, yeah.

10:53.960 --> 10:56.640
But the matter has simply been tabled.

10:56.640 --> 11:02.090
If protecting her would threaten 
the Yamada clan or you...

11:02.650 --> 11:03.350
Then...

11:04.640 --> 11:05.550
What is it?

11:05.550 --> 11:08.780
Her? I'm impressed you figured it out.

11:08.780 --> 11:09.980
Of course I did.

11:10.250 --> 11:11.820
I've got a good <i>eye</i> for evaluating people.

11:11.820 --> 11:14.360
You sure do love making jokes like that.

11:15.710 --> 11:17.860
Nice to meet you, Master.

11:18.670 --> 11:20.610
Nice to meet you, Nurugai.

11:20.610 --> 11:23.700
But you needn't call me "Master."

11:23.700 --> 11:26.430
I haven't taught you anything.

11:28.120 --> 11:31.770
Let's not waste any time checking 
out this current you found.

11:31.770 --> 11:33.130
Keep your voice down.

11:33.440 --> 11:35.380
We'll take our time and be careful.

11:35.800 --> 11:38.730
The greatest threat we face 
currently is that monster.

11:38.730 --> 11:40.420
It can't possibly be human.

11:40.840 --> 11:43.430
We should consider how we'll 
respond if we encounter it.

11:43.430 --> 11:47.630
If we just intend to flee, then we 
should be able to do what we did earlier.

11:48.870 --> 11:51.190
You underestimate me.

11:57.360 --> 11:58.990
You saved us, Master.

11:58.990 --> 11:59.940
Thank you.

12:01.200 --> 12:02.200
Master!

12:02.520 --> 12:03.450
Huh?

12:03.450 --> 12:07.450
I thought I'd taken off his head. Not bad.

12:15.110 --> 12:16.790
I've gotten used to that.

12:18.670 --> 12:22.890
You have to be alive to become Tan,

12:23.840 --> 12:25.800
but because you're so 
annoying, I'll kill you.

12:25.800 --> 12:29.660
<i>What should I do? I should run, but...</i>

12:30.940 --> 12:33.310
<i>No, I have to kill it now.</i>

12:38.650 --> 12:41.070
Tameshi-itto-ryu Ultimate...

12:41.070 --> 12:42.410
Wait, Ten—

12:44.680 --> 12:46.450
<i>Pounding Torrent!</i>

12:52.670 --> 12:54.960
I told you, I'm used to that.

13:04.680 --> 13:06.560
Tenza!

13:15.430 --> 13:16.940
Hey, Master.

13:16.940 --> 13:19.930
Why'd you take in a guy like me?

13:19.930 --> 13:21.510
Mind your language.

13:21.930 --> 13:24.850
Why did you take me in, Master?

13:25.300 --> 13:28.070
Taking lives is our job.

13:28.070 --> 13:31.280
I wish to spend the rest 
of my time helping people.

13:31.600 --> 13:35.210
It's true that you're 
a bit rough around the edges...

13:36.440 --> 13:38.830
but I sense potential in you.

13:38.830 --> 13:41.310
Well, aren't you great?

13:41.310 --> 13:43.660
I don't get why you'd help people.

13:49.920 --> 13:51.470
Damn it.

13:51.470 --> 13:53.590
You're sloppy with your sword.

13:53.590 --> 13:55.580
You're allowing your 
emotions to control you.

13:55.580 --> 13:58.810
Your rage, and your doubt.

13:59.510 --> 14:02.710
It's not like I want to be a samurai.

14:02.710 --> 14:04.490
This is pointless.

14:04.780 --> 14:07.960
I'm not asking you to follow 
the samurai code from the start.

14:07.960 --> 14:12.120
But someday, if you find 
something you want to protect,

14:12.600 --> 14:15.870
the sword skills you've developed 
will definitely help you.

14:16.430 --> 14:18.620
Something I want to protect...

14:19.090 --> 14:21.630
Look at that cherry blossom tree.

14:21.630 --> 14:24.520
Its trunk is lean, 
and its flowers are still buds.

14:24.950 --> 14:28.630
But buds contain all manner of potential.

14:29.040 --> 14:30.890
So do you.

14:30.890 --> 14:35.200
The day will come when your 
buds of potential blossom.

14:35.890 --> 14:36.570
Trash.

14:36.570 --> 14:37.320
Good for nothing.

14:37.320 --> 14:37.940
Useless.

14:37.940 --> 14:39.110
A street urchin, huh?

14:40.400 --> 14:42.200
Now, continue.

14:42.670 --> 14:43.820
I don't.

14:44.190 --> 14:46.690
I don't have potential!

14:47.700 --> 14:50.240
I don't have status or money.

14:50.280 --> 14:54.200
Since the day I was born, 
I've never had potential!

14:56.180 --> 14:57.530
I'm quitting.

14:57.530 --> 14:58.540
What?

14:58.540 --> 14:59.910
I said I'm quitting.

14:59.910 --> 15:02.290
I've had enough of this strict lifestyle.

15:02.290 --> 15:04.520
I wanna live how I want to live.

15:05.200 --> 15:06.880
Are you serious about that?

15:06.880 --> 15:07.970
Yeah.

15:07.970 --> 15:10.610
Then I have a condition.

15:10.610 --> 15:12.050
A condition?

15:12.050 --> 15:13.600
Just one blow.

15:14.210 --> 15:18.680
Anytime, anywhere. Land a single blow on me.

15:19.100 --> 15:20.560
If you can do that,

15:20.560 --> 15:22.480
then I'll allow you to quit.

15:26.740 --> 15:28.840
I don't have time for this.

15:30.860 --> 15:34.660
Where are you going? 
The dojo is in the other direction.

15:35.040 --> 15:37.290
Shion told me about your deal.

15:37.290 --> 15:39.660
Have you already landed a blow on him?

15:40.060 --> 15:42.140
Are you going to drag me back?

15:42.140 --> 15:43.720
Do as you please.

15:43.720 --> 15:44.670
Huh?

15:44.670 --> 15:47.910
But before you go, accompany me on a walk.

15:47.910 --> 15:50.860
I woke up too early and have nothing to do.

15:59.560 --> 16:02.560
<b>Namu Amida Butsu</b>

16:01.000 --> 16:06.070
Shion's former junior sleeps here.

16:06.450 --> 16:07.780
His name was Tesshin.

16:08.270 --> 16:09.780
His junior?

16:09.780 --> 16:12.610
Like you, he was dissolute.

16:12.970 --> 16:15.820
He had talent, but he lacked motivation.

16:16.120 --> 16:20.450
Then Master must've put him 
through the wringer, like me.

16:22.160 --> 16:26.220
At the time, Shion focused 
on improving his own skills.

16:26.220 --> 16:29.250
He didn't have nearly the same passion 
for teaching as he does now.

16:29.610 --> 16:34.590
In the end, Tesshin said he'd live 
how he pleased and left the dojo.

16:34.590 --> 16:37.600
For a while, things stayed the same.

16:38.480 --> 16:42.770
That day, Shion went out 
to test his sword just like he always did

16:42.770 --> 16:45.080
and stood before the criminal.

16:48.440 --> 16:53.240
But Shion wouldn't lower 
the sword he raised.

16:53.510 --> 16:54.800
Could it be?

16:54.800 --> 16:55.720
Yes.

16:55.720 --> 17:00.490
Shion realized the criminal 
before him was Tesshin.

17:00.920 --> 17:03.110
After leaving the dojo,

17:03.110 --> 17:07.010
Tesshin eventually struggled 
to feed himself and turned to crime.

17:07.400 --> 17:10.250
What did Master do?

17:10.250 --> 17:13.760
Naturally, he killed him 
as a Yamada Asaemon.

17:14.290 --> 17:18.260
Shion clearly heard Tesshin's last words.

17:18.550 --> 17:20.760
Apparently, he said this.

17:22.340 --> 17:25.020
"Master, I'm sorry."

17:25.660 --> 17:29.750
That's when Shion became passionate about

17:29.750 --> 17:31.980
teaching his juniors 
and began helping people.

17:32.370 --> 17:36.590
If you live the life of a scoundrel, 
you might eventually end up the same way.

17:37.040 --> 17:40.910
He probably felt it would be 
a waste for that to happen.

17:40.910 --> 17:42.490
<i>So do you.</i>

17:42.490 --> 17:46.920
<i>The day will come when your 
buds of potential blossom.</i>

17:46.920 --> 17:48.000
Well?

17:48.380 --> 17:51.770
Will you run from this place 
without landing a single blow on him?

18:01.440 --> 18:02.720
Ah, Tenza.

18:03.360 --> 18:06.290
Master, please spar with me.

18:16.550 --> 18:18.490
You seem different than before.

18:19.370 --> 18:24.370
<i>I've never seriously devoted myself 
to anything before, but...</i>

18:30.910 --> 18:32.540
Your flanks are undefended.

18:34.010 --> 18:35.550
Again.

18:36.870 --> 18:38.320
Again.

18:39.620 --> 18:41.140
Again.

18:42.450 --> 18:44.130
Again.

18:44.580 --> 18:47.180
<i>I want to land a blow on him.</i>

18:51.360 --> 18:55.630
<i>He's the first person 
to believe in my potential.</i>

18:56.440 --> 18:58.040
<i>Hey, Master.</i>

18:58.040 --> 19:01.920
<i>Can I believe in my own potential?</i>

19:01.920 --> 19:05.200
<i>And like you said, someday...</i>

19:06.300 --> 19:09.050
<i>Someday, will I find 
someone I want to protect?</i>

19:21.960 --> 19:24.510
<i>My fingertips are growing cold.</i>

19:25.660 --> 19:29.750
<i>But I'm burning from the chest up.</i>

19:31.010 --> 19:32.480
<i>I see.</i>

19:33.050 --> 19:35.560
<i>I'm dying.</i>

19:36.160 --> 19:41.740
<i>We're all going to be 
killed by this monster.</i>

19:50.500 --> 19:52.710
<i>I won't let that happen!</i>

19:56.460 --> 19:59.840
<i>Even if I die, I'll make sure they escape.</i>

19:59.840 --> 20:01.680
<i>I don't care how I do it.</i>

20:02.130 --> 20:05.600
<i>I'll do everything I can 
to buy time for them.</i>

20:14.200 --> 20:15.900
<i>Stay away.</i>

20:16.220 --> 20:19.150
<i>Run. Please run.</i>

20:29.320 --> 20:32.560
<i>Both of you, run.</i>

20:33.420 --> 20:35.460
<i>Don't, Master.</i>

20:35.460 --> 20:36.920
<i>You can't beat it.</i>

20:36.920 --> 20:38.420
<i>You know that.</i>

20:39.040 --> 20:41.430
<i>My throat's too damaged to speak.</i>

20:42.220 --> 20:44.660
<i>Master, please run.</i>

20:44.660 --> 20:46.300
<i>Just one word.</i>

20:46.720 --> 20:47.810
<i>Let me speak.</i>

21:04.800 --> 21:06.070
Tenza!

21:21.360 --> 21:23.590
<i>Master, I'm sorry.</i>

21:23.590 --> 21:25.340
<i>You took care of me, but I...</i>

21:26.340 --> 21:28.850
<i>Nurugai-san, please live.</i>

21:29.310 --> 21:31.350
<i>You have potential.</i>

21:33.790 --> 21:35.240
<i>Potential...</i>

21:35.720 --> 21:37.750
<i>I wonder what potential I had.</i>

21:50.370 --> 21:52.350
He was pretty tough.

22:03.500 --> 22:06.510
Why are we abandoning him? I'm going back!

22:06.510 --> 22:08.360
Don't.

22:08.360 --> 22:11.010
This is what Tenza wanted.

22:11.010 --> 22:15.020
But still... you're his master, right?

22:15.020 --> 22:16.580
Isn't he your student?

22:16.580 --> 22:17.520
He's more than that!

22:18.640 --> 22:22.020
We're brothers who wanted the same thing.

22:22.020 --> 22:27.530
He risked his life for us. 
I can't waste that.

22:28.520 --> 22:30.570
We can't beat that monster right now.

22:30.570 --> 22:32.720
If we hadn't run, we would've all died.

22:32.720 --> 22:34.540
We had to retreat.

22:34.540 --> 22:38.860
But I swear we'll make them pay.

23:06.320 --> 23:10.370
All right! I hit you!

23:10.370 --> 23:11.820
That was impressive.

23:11.820 --> 23:14.020
Now you're free to do as you please.

23:17.330 --> 23:22.670
Master, will you keep 
teaching—no, I mean...

23:22.670 --> 23:27.480
Master, I humbly request that you 
continue teaching me to use a sword.

23:28.110 --> 23:29.370
Of course.
